      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "2 · WHAT DOES JEV SEE, AND WHEN?",
      "originalText": "2 · WHAT DOES JEV SEE, AND WHEN?",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b0k",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "claude2-q2-b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2098.8877551569735,
      "y": 1299.766166558251,
      "width": 328.90000000000003,
      "height": 178.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1897689483,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1492266413,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789699072474,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Classifier sits BEFORE Extractor, so it reads\nraw text (or just a headline).\n\nJEV cannot write text — only pick from\noptions you fix in advance. So its list\n(announcement / result / comment / analysis)\nmust be closed. It looks closed at this level.\n\nQuestion: does the TYPE route the Extractor\n(different questions per type), or is it just\na label? Routing is the stronger design.",
      "originalText": "Classifier sits BEFORE Extractor, so it reads\nraw text (or just a headline).\n\nJEV cannot write text — only pick from\noptions you fix in advance. So its list\n(announcement / result / comment / analysis)\nmust be closed. It looks closed at this level.\n\nQuestion: does the TYPE route the Extractor\n(different questions per type), or is it just\na label? Routing is the stronger design.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b0l",
      "autoResize": true
    },
