    {
      "id": "claude2-q3-b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2598,
      "y": 1300,
      "width": 343.20000000000005,
      "height": 162.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 99746988,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 749095971,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789699031756,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Telegram is drawn as one box. Today it is three:\n\n  🚨  loud ceremony      (career event)\n  📰  digest main item   (substance about him)\n  ·    mentions line      (everything else)\n\nIf the Decider only answers \"post / don't\",\nthe three tiers disappear. Is that the intent?\nIt would be a simplification — worth saying\nout loud rather than losing by accident.",
      "originalText": "Telegram is drawn as one box. Today it is three:\n\n  🚨  loud ceremony      (career event)\n  📰  digest main item   (substance about him)\n  ·    mentions line      (everything else)\n\nIf the Decider only answers \"post / don't\",\nthe three tiers disappear. Is that the intent?\nIt would be a simplification — worth saying\nout loud rather than losing by accident.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b0o",
      "autoResize": true
    },
