      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789699031756,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "The chain runs left to right and stops.\n\nToday your verdicts (docs/article-feedback.md,\nthe graded corpus, the bench) are how any of\nthis improves — but none of it is on the board.\n\nIf 'tested in isolation' is the requirement,\nthen each of the four parts needs its own\ngraded set and its own score. That is a\nstation too, not a side activity.",
      "originalText": "The chain runs left to right and stops.\n\nToday your verdicts (docs/article-feedback.md,\nthe graded corpus, the bench) are how any of\nthis improves — but none of it is on the board.\n\nIf 'tested in isolation' is the requirement,\nthen each of the four parts needs its own\ngraded set and its own score. That is a\nstation too, not a side activity.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b0r",
      "autoResize": true
    },
