      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "A · WHICH STORY IS THIS?  pick from a shortlist, and if new,\n     WRITE the fact it asserts.  Needs a generative model.\n     Measured: Haiku 301-305 of 340 · Qwen3.8 Flash ~294 · gate 302.\n\nB · SHOULD THE GROUP SEE IT?  a bucket. No text needed.\n     Measured: Haiku 36/45 · JEV 39/45 · gemma4 38/45 (tune split).\n\nYour board already splits these: Semantic dedup = A, Decider = B.\nThat is the part I would keep hardest.",
      "originalText": "A · WHICH STORY IS THIS?  pick from a shortlist, and if new,\n     WRITE the fact it asserts.  Needs a generative model.\n     Measured: Haiku 301-305 of 340 · Qwen3.8 Flash ~294 · gate 302.\n\nB · SHOULD THE GROUP SEE IT?  a bucket. No text needed.\n     Measured: Haiku 36/45 · JEV 39/45 · gemma4 38/45 (tune split).\n\nYour board already splits these: Semantic dedup = A, Decider = B.\nThat is the part I would keep hardest.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
